<title>GERMANY: Siemens says Q1 '96/97 group net down.</title>
<headline>Siemens says Q1 '96/97 group net down.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter to December 31. (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			478     vs     503</p>
<p>    Group sales			  20,900     vs  19,700</p>
<p>    Of which domestic		   7,900     vs   7,500</p>
<p>		 foreign		   13,000     vs  12,200</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders	    27,000     vs  22,200</p>
<p>    Of which domestic		   9,500     vs   8,800</p>
<p>		 foreign		   17,500     vs  13,400</p>
<p>    Investment			    2,000     vs   1,500</p>
<p>    Group workforce (31/12)	 377,000     vs 379,000 (30/9)</p>
<p>    Of which domestic		 200,000     vs 203,000</p>
<p>		 foreign		  177,000     vs 176,000</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German engineering and electricals group is Siemens AG.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
